ord here runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, February to March came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those years, and July to August in 25. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 25% of normal in November to December and 40% in March to April. Grid 8896 and grid 9196 both had their driest year in 2000, at 54% of normal.</p>"}
